        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 818CMH, Single Cylinder Camino Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nModern Deco styled design, the Kwikset Camino Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern deco design aesthetic. The Kwikset Camino single cylinder door entry set is operated by key outside and turn knob inside. Backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty the Camino handle is available in 5 color options.  Good for 1-3/4\" thick doors with 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/KABA-201526D41-specifications.gif?v=1704354680\" width\"450\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Kwikset Camino Handleset Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: <a href=\"/products/dummy-camino-handleset-kwikset-819cmh\"><b>Camino Dummy Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications & Features</b> for the Kwikset Camino Single Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length Overall: 17-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt to Latch Spacing: 5-1/2\" center to center</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Throughbolt: Adjustable, Min: 8-13/32 - Max: 9-11/16</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" doors.</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed, Reversible for Left or Right handing</li>\r\n<li>ANSI/BHMA A156.5 Grade 1 Deadbolt</li>\r\n<li>Anti-Pick New Advanced SmartKey Security</li>\r\n<li>Bump-resistant deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-pry shield.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe deadbolt on this single cylinder handleset is thrown or retracted by a key from the outside or by a thumbturn on the inside. The latch is retracted by a thumbpiece from the outside and by a turn knob on the inside.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim finish will match the exterior handleset finish that you choose.</i><br>\r\n<b>*Vedani Lever NOT available in 514 Iron Black Finish</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Single Cylinder Camino Handleset, Kwikset 818CMH",
                "description": "Kwikset 818CMH Single Cylinder Camino Handleset. Modern Deco styled design, the Kwikset Camino Handleset has concealed screw mounts for a super sleek look. By making something that have could been too simple into something that looks chic, the sleek design of this  handleset exemplifies the modern deco design aesthetic. The Kwikset Camino single cylinder door entry set is operated by key outside and turn knob inside. Backed by a lifetime mechanical and finish warranty the Camino handle is available in 5 color options. ",
